    <meta property="og:description" content="The rational discovery of covalent drugs depends on an expanding toolset of techniques. Here, Daniel Nomura and colleagues highlight covalent drugs that have achieved success over the past decade and discuss the tools and strategies that facilitate their discovery, describing two complementary approaches, namely, ligand-first and electrophile-first strategies."/>
